 651:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** /**
 652:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   * @brief  Enables or disables the CAN Time TriggerOperation communication mode.
 653:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   * @note   DLC must be programmed as 8 in order Time Stamp (2 bytes) to be 
 654:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   *         sent over the CAN bus.  
 655:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   * @param  CANx: where x can be 1,2 or 3 to select the CAN peripheral.
 656:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   * @param  NewState: Mode new state. This parameter can be: ENABLE or DISABLE.
