 699:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                 ##### CAN Frames Transmission functions #####
 700:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****  ===============================================================================  
 701:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****     [..] This section provides functions allowing to 
 702:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****       (+) Initiate and transmit a CAN frame message (if there is an empty mailbox).
