1252:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** /** @defgroup CAN_Group6 Interrupts and flags management functions
1253:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****  *  @brief   Interrupts and flags management functions
1254:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****  *
1255:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** @verbatim   
1256:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****  ===============================================================================
1257:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****               ##### Interrupts and flags management functions #####
1258:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****  ===============================================================================  
1259:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** 
1260:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****      [..] This section provides functions allowing to configure the CAN Interrupts 
1261:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****           and to get the status and clear flags and Interrupts pending bits.
1262:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   
1263:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****           The CAN provides 14 Interrupts sources and 15 Flags:
1264:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** 
1265:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****    
1266:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   *** Flags ***
1267:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   =============
1268:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****     [..] The 15 flags can be divided on 4 groups: 
1269:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** 
1270:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****       (+) Transmit Flags
1271:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_FLAG_RQCP0, 
1272:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_FLAG_RQCP1, 
1273:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_FLAG_RQCP2  : Request completed MailBoxes 0, 1 and 2  Flags
1274:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                Set when the last request (transmit or abort)
1275:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                has been performed. 
1276:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** 
1277:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****       (+) Receive Flags
1278:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** 
1279:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** 
1280:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_FLAG_FMP0,
1281:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_FLAG_FMP1   : FIFO 0 and 1 Message Pending Flags 
1282:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                set to signal that messages are pending in the receive 
1283:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                FIFO.
1284:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                These Flags are cleared only by hardware. 
ARM GAS  /tmp/cclurMk5.s 			page 24


1285:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** 
1286:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_FLAG_FF0,
1287:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_FLAG_FF1    : FIFO 0 and 1 Full Flags
1288:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                set when three messages are stored in the selected 
1289:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                FIFO.                        
1290:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** 
1291:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_FLAG_FOV0              
1292:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_FLAG_FOV1   : FIFO 0 and 1 Overrun Flags
1293:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                set when a new message has been received and passed 
1294:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                the filter while the FIFO was full.         
1295:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** 
1296:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****       (+) Operating Mode Flags
1297:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** 
1298:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_FLAG_WKU    : Wake up Flag
1299:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                set to signal that a SOF bit has been detected while 
1300:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                the CAN hardware was in Sleep mode. 
1301:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         
1302:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_FLAG_SLAK   : Sleep acknowledge Flag
1303:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                Set to signal that the CAN has entered Sleep Mode. 
1304:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****     
1305:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****       (+) Error Flags
1306:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** 
1307:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_FLAG_EWG    : Error Warning Flag
1308:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                Set when the warning limit has been reached (Receive 
1309:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                Error Counter or Transmit Error Counter greater than 96). 
1310:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                This Flag is cleared only by hardware.
1311:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                             
1312:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_FLAG_EPV    : Error Passive Flag
1313:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                Set when the Error Passive limit has been reached 
1314:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                (Receive Error Counter or Transmit Error Counter 
1315:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                greater than 127).
1316:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                This Flag is cleared only by hardware.
1317:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                              
1318:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_FLAG_BOF    : Bus-Off Flag
1319:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                set when CAN enters the bus-off state. The bus-off 
1320:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                state is entered on TEC overflow, greater than 255.
1321:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                This Flag is cleared only by hardware.
1322:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                    
1323:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_FLAG_LEC    : Last error code Flag
1324:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                set If a message has been transferred (reception or
1325:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                transmission) with error, and the error code is hold.              
1326:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                            
1327:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   *** Interrupts ***
1328:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   ==================
1329:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****     [..] The 14 interrupts can be divided on 4 groups: 
1330:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   
1331:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****       (+) Transmit interrupt
1332:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   
1333:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_IT_TME   :  Transmit mailbox empty Interrupt
1334:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                              if enabled, this interrupt source is pending when 
1335:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                              no transmit request are pending for Tx mailboxes.      
1336:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** 
1337:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****       (+) Receive Interrupts
1338:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****          
1339:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_IT_FMP0,
1340:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_IT_FMP1    :  FIFO 0 and FIFO1 message pending Interrupts
1341:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                if enabled, these interrupt sources are pending 
ARM GAS  /tmp/cclurMk5.s 			page 25


1342:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                when messages are pending in the receive FIFO.
1343:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                The corresponding interrupt pending bits are cleared 
1344:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                only by hardware.
1345:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                 
1346:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_IT_FF0,              
1347:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_IT_FF1     :  FIFO 0 and FIFO1 full Interrupts
1348:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                if enabled, these interrupt sources are pending 
1349:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                when three messages are stored in the selected FIFO.
1350:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         
1351:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_IT_FOV0,        
1352:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_IT_FOV1    :  FIFO 0 and FIFO1 overrun Interrupts        
1353:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                if enabled, these interrupt sources are pending 
1354:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                when a new message has been received and passed 
1355:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                the filter while the FIFO was full.
1356:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** 
1357:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****       (+) Operating Mode Interrupts
1358:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****          
1359:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_IT_WKU     :  Wake-up Interrupt
1360:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                if enabled, this interrupt source is pending when 
1361:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                a SOF bit has been detected while the CAN hardware 
1362:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                was in Sleep mode.
1363:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                   
1364:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_IT_SLK     :  Sleep acknowledge Interrupt
1365:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                if enabled, this interrupt source is pending when 
1366:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                the CAN has entered Sleep Mode.       
1367:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** 
1368:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****       (+) Error Interrupts 
1369:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         
1370:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_IT_EWG     :  Error warning Interrupt 
1371:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                if enabled, this interrupt source is pending when
1372:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                the warning limit has been reached (Receive Error 
1373:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                Counter or Transmit Error Counter=96). 
1374:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                
1375:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_IT_EPV     :  Error passive Interrupt        
1376:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                if enabled, this interrupt source is pending when
1377:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                the Error Passive limit has been reached (Receive 
1378:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                Error Counter or Transmit Error Counter>127).
1379:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                           
1380:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_IT_BOF     :  Bus-off Interrupt
1381:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                if enabled, this interrupt source is pending when
1382:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                CAN enters the bus-off state. The bus-off state is 
1383:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                entered on TEC overflow, greater than 255.
1384:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                This Flag is cleared only by hardware.
1385:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                   
1386:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_IT_LEC     :  Last error code Interrupt        
1387:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                if enabled, this interrupt source is pending  when
1388:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                a message has been transferred (reception or
1389:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                transmission) with error, and the error code is hold.
1390:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                           
1391:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_IT_ERR     :  Error Interrupt
1392:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                if enabled, this interrupt source is pending when 
1393:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                                an error condition is pending.      
1394:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****                       
1395:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****     [..] Managing the CAN controller events :
1396:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****  
1397:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****          The user should identify which mode will be used in his application to 
1398:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****          manage the CAN controller events: Polling mode or Interrupt mode.
ARM GAS  /tmp/cclurMk5.s 			page 26


1399:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   
1400:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****       (#) In the Polling Mode it is advised to use the following functions:
1401:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_GetFlagStatus() : to check if flags events occur. 
1402:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_ClearFlag()     : to clear the flags events.
1403:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   
1404:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c **** 
1405:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   
1406:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****       (#) In the Interrupt Mode it is advised to use the following functions:
1407:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_ITConfig()       : to enable or disable the interrupt source.
1408:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_GetITStatus()    : to check if Interrupt occurs.
1409:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         (++) CAN_ClearITPendingBit() : to clear the Interrupt pending Bit 
1410:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****             (corresponding Flag).
1411:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****         -@@-  This function has no impact on CAN_IT_FMP0 and CAN_IT_FMP1 Interrupts 
1412:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****              pending bits since there are cleared only by hardware. 
