1567:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   * @param  CANx: where x can be 1,2 or 3 to select the CAN peripheral.
1568:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   * @param  CAN_FLAG: specifies the flag to clear.
1569:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_can.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
